\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Huglin heliothermal index on a 10-year synthetic temperate site at latitude 51.5 degrees north. Shaded horizontal bands mark approximate viticultural suitability ranges: below 1500 is too cool, 1500 to 1800 is Cool, 1800 to 2100 is Temperate, 2100 to 2400 is Warm, above 2400 is Hot. The sample falls mostly in the Cool range.}}{4}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:huglin}{{3}{4}{Huglin heliothermal index on a 10-year synthetic temperate site at latitude 51.5 degrees north. Shaded horizontal bands mark approximate viticultural suitability ranges: below 1500 is too cool, 1500 to 1800 is Cool, 1800 to 2100 is Temperate, 2100 to 2400 is Warm, above 2400 is Hot. The sample falls mostly in the Cool range}{figure.caption.4}{}}
